        //创建Sign
        java.createSign(algorithm)
        //设置密钥
        .setPublicKey(key)
        .setPrivateKey(key)
        ```
        > 签名参数 data支持ByteArray|inputStream|String
        ```js
        //签名输出 ByteArray HexString
        sign.sign(data)
        sign.signHex(data)
        ```
